      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SMART ROSCOE (8) has a strong record this journey here with two wins and a minor from five starts. Below best last time at this track (19.71) in a Mix 6/7 FIN, finishing a 4 length eighth. Expected to be in the finish. RITA PAIGE (4) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when third (24.02) in a Restricted WIN H at Bendigo. Can find the frame this time. OPALINA (7) turned in a solid run last start over 350m at this track finishing 5th and beaten only 2.75 lengths (19.71). Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Has the ability to give this a shake. ASTON ROCHELLE (2) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot in a fast run most recently.",
